 # Local AI Workspace for Android
 
 An Android-first, offline-by-default AI workspace with a runtime-neutral Model Manager. The app keeps projects, chats, imported documents, local retrieval evidence, memory and model metadata in an on-device Room database. Model binaries stay in app-private storage; they are never stored in Room.
+
+Version **0.1.12** keeps actual chat generation and file reading running when returning to Workspace, with progress, reopen and explicit Stop generation. **Files** shows extraction errors, text previews, selection and a real Summarize request. Newly imported readable files become next-turn context; paperclip images use the existing vision preparation path. Selected sources omitted by the three-passage/context limit remain selected. No OCR or full-file model analysis is claimed.
+
+Short greetings without selected files skip unrelated retrieval/memory/default evidence instructions. Retrieval runs off Main and rejects unrelated candidates. An already initialized vision engine can serve text without reinitialization, while text-to-vision still loads actual vision support. Startup warm preparation and the existing single-engine/private verification cache remain. CPU decode speed, initial cold load and model factual quality are not claimed fixed.
+
+**167 app tests executed/PASS**,2 compatibility tests UP-TO-DATE; full testDebugUnitTest/assembleDebug/lintDebug PASS in2m15s. Release/signature/native comparison PASS1m16s; lint0errors/73existing warnings. Room remains schema3, no migration/deletion. New physical UI/native/file-response/timing validation **NOT_EXECUTED**. [Implementation, limits and phone tests](docs/CHAT_FILES_AND_BACKGROUND_012.md). [Verified artifact](docs/validation/apk-012.json).
+
+[Download 0.1.12 APK from Drive](https://drive.google.com/file/d/10_AIAPomtCQnemliE0qksZLEGTM346WO/view?usp=drivesdk) (91.67MB / 87.42MiB, ARM64, versionCode13). Install as an update without clearing data. Metadata readback verifies filename, size, MIME and private sharing; native libraries match0.1.11. Earlier APKs remain intact.
+
+## Previous release — 0.1.11
 
 Version **0.1.11** prepares the last selected usable LiteRT model from application startup, with real **Active model** loading/integrity/ready/error/cancel/retry in Workspace. Closing a chat does not cancel shared preparation; new chats use the remembered selection and isolated native conversation state. A ready/running identical preparation is shared, and the idle engine no longer has a ten-minute expiry. Worker-lifetime receipts avoid repeated SHA scans of unchanged private files. One engine remains resident: switching models/context/vision/backend, memory pressure or Android process reclamation can still require loading. GGUF retains its existing first-send path; CPU decode speed and the prior semantic relevance failure are unchanged.
 
